Hi all

I'm hoping somebody will be able to describe a possible workflow for taking some measurements of bird calls in seewave. I have a whole bunch of recordings of a Chiffchaff. This species gives a call that I describe as 'hweet'. Let's say I have 100 recordings of Chiffchaff and in these recordings, there are 20 hweet calls. If I measure maximum frequency, minimum frequency and duration of each call note, that's 6000 measurements to take! What is most efficient way to do this? Are there any online tutorials that give example code?

Thanks
Ross

